{"path":"chrono/is_clock","title":"std::chrono::is_clock","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::chrono::</span>is_clock","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/chrono/is_clock","section":"chrono","kind":"page","summary":"If T satisfies the Clock requirements, provides the member constant value equal true. For any other type, value is false.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/chrono\">&lt;chrono&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx20\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> T <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw1\">struct</span> is_clock<span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>If <code>T</code> satisfies the <a href=\"/w/cpp/named_req/Clock\"><em class=\"t-named-req\">Clock</em></a> requirements, provides the member constant <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">value</span></code> equal <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code>. For any other type, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">value</span></code> is <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span></code>.\n</p><p>For the purpose of this trait, the extent to which an implementation determines that a type cannot meet the <a href=\"/w/cpp/named_req/Clock\"><em class=\"t-named-req\">Clock</em></a> requirements is unspecified, except that a minimum <code>T</code> shall not qualify as a <a href=\"/w/cpp/named_req/Clock\"><em class=\"t-named-req\">Clock</em></a> unless it meets all following conditions:\n</p>\n<ul><li> Each of the following <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/identifiers#Qualified_identifiers\">qualified identifiers</a> is valid and denotes a type:\n</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> <code>T::rep</code>\n</li><li> <code>T::period</code>\n</li><li> <code>T::duration</code>\n</li><li> <code>T::time_point</code>\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n<ul><li> Each of the following expressions is well-formed when treated as an <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/expressions#Potentially-evaluated_expressions\">unevaluated operand</a>:\n</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> <code>T::is_steady</code>\n</li><li> <code>T::now()</code>\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n<p>If the program adds specializations for <code>std::is_clock</code> or <code>std::is_clock_v</code>, the behavior is undefined.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Template_parameters\">Template parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> T\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> a type to check\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Helper_variable_template\">Helper variable template</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx20\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> T <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"kw4\">bool</span> is_clock_v <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> is_clock<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">value</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"t-inherited\">\n<h2 id=\"Inherited_from_std::integral_constant\">Inherited from <a href=\"/w/cpp/types/integral_constant\"> <span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>integral_constant</a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"Member_constants\">Member constants</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span>value</span></span></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-cmark\">[static]</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>   <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code> if <code>T</code> satisfies the <a href=\"/w/cpp/named_req/Clock\"><em class=\"t-named-req\">Clock</em></a> requirements, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span></code> otherwise  <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public static member constant)</span>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Member_functions\">Member functions</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span>operator bool</span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>   converts the object to <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">bool</span></span>, returns <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">value</span></code>  <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span>operator()</span></span></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx14\">(C++14)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>   returns <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">value</span></code>  <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Member_types\">Member types</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-hitem\">\n<td>  Type\n</td>\n<td>  Definition\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <code>value_type</code>\n</td>\n<td>  <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">bool</span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <code>type</code>\n</td>\n<td>  <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/integral_constant\"><span class=\"kw652\">std::<span class=\"me2\">integral_constant</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">bool</span>, value<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"Possible_implementation\">Possible implementation</h3>\n<table class=\"eq-fun-cpp-table\">\n<tr>\n<td>\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw1\">class</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"kw1\">struct</span> is_clock <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/types/integral_constant\"><span class=\"kw655\">std::<span class=\"me2\">false_type</span></span></a> <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw1\">class</span> T<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>\n    requires\n        requires\n        <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n            <span class=\"kw1\">typename</span> T<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">rep</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n            <span class=\"kw1\">typename</span> T<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">period</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n            <span class=\"kw1\">typename</span> T<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">duration</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n            <span class=\"kw1\">typename</span> T<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">time_point</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n            T<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">is_steady</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// type is not checked</span>\n            T<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">now</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>     <span class=\"co1\">// return type is not checked</span>\n        <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n<span class=\"kw1\">struct</span> is_clock<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/types/integral_constant\"><span class=\"kw654\">std::<span class=\"me2\">true_type</span></span></a> <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></code></pre>\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<p>If <code>T</code> otherwise meets the <a href=\"/w/cpp/named_req/Clock\"><em class=\"t-named-req\">Clock</em></a> requirements, but <code>T::is_steady</code> is not of type <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">bool</span></span>, or <code>T::now()</code> is not of type <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">T<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">time_point</span></span>, the result of <code>is_clock_v&lt;T&gt;</code> is unspecified.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;chrono&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;ratio&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\nstatic_assert\n<span class=\"br0\">(</span>\n    std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">is_clock_v</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/utc_clock\"><span class=\"kw2587\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">utc_clock</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> and\n    not std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">is_clock_v</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/duration\"><span class=\"kw997\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">duration</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/ratio/ratio\"><span class=\"kw1549\">std::<span class=\"me2\">exa</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n</div>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Template parameters","id":"Template_parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Helper variable template","id":"Helper_variable_template"},{"depth":2,"text":"Inherited from std::integral_constant","id":"Inherited_from_std::integral_constant"},{"depth":3,"text":"Member constants","id":"Member_constants"},{"depth":3,"text":"Member functions","id":"Member_functions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Member types","id":"Member_types"},{"depth":3,"text":"Possible implementation","id":"Possible_implementation"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"chrono","title":"Date and time utilities"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::chrono::is_clock","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++20. If T satisfies the Clock requirements, provides the member constant value equal true."},{"label":"Template parameters","note":"T"},{"label":"Helper variable template"},{"label":"Inherited from std::integral_constant","children":[{"label":"Member constants"},{"label":"Member functions"},{"label":"Member types"},{"label":"Possible implementation"},{"label":"Notes","note":"If T otherwise meets the Clock requirements, but T::is_steady is not of type const bool, or T::now() is not of type T::time_point, the result of is_clock_v<T>…"},{"label":"Example"}]}]},"standards":["C++14","C++20"],"wordCount":269,"codeBlockCount":2}
